"Identity keys, the POPOPX Compute Credits balance and privacy node badges are kept in this device's Keychain and local encrypted store. They are never uploaded, only you can move them, and a reinstall without a backup loses them." = "身分密鑰、POPOPX 算力點餘額與隱私節點徽章存放在本機鑰匙串與本地加密存儲中，永不上傳，只有你能轉移；沒有備份就重裝將全部丟失。";
"Push token and replay protection" = "推送令牌與防重放";
"Push delivery uses an Apple device token bound to the notification mode you chose. The token carries no message content, is reissued when you change server or mode, and is used once so a captured token cannot be replayed." = "推送使用與你所選通知模式綁定的 Apple 設備令牌。令牌不含任何訊息內容，在更換服務器或通知模式時重新簽發，且一次一用，被截獲也無法重放。";
"The camera guard stays local" = "防偷窺相機僅本地處理";
"The anti-peeping guard switches the front camera on only while a top-secret sheet is open, at the lowest resolution, processes every frame on this device and stops the stream when the sheet closes. Nothing is written to disk and nothing is uploaded." = "防旁觀引擎只在絕密彈窗打開期間啓用前置攝像頭，取最低分辨率，每一幀只在本機處理，彈窗關閉立即停止採集。不寫盤，也不上傳。";
"Screenshots, recordings and offline hops" = "截屏、錄屏與離線跳數";
"Your controls" = "控制權在你";
"You can export or delete any identity, erase the local database or trigger Panic Wipe at any time. Deletion is irreversible because no server holds a copy." = "你可以隨時導出或刪除任一身分、抹除本地數據庫或觸發緊急物理擦除。任何服務器都不持有副本，所以刪除不可恢復。";

