"An old self-destruct passcode is still on this device, but only the app's own keypad could take it and that keypad no longer appears: it can neither be triggered nor seen now, and it only makes the row in Privacy and Security read enabled. Enter it correctly and we turn it off together with that row; enter it wrong and nothing changes this time, and the two new codes above are not written either. If the authentication method is still on the app passcode level it also falls back to system authentication. This step does not rebuild the database keys and not one character of chat data moves." = "本機仍留有一箇舊的自毀密碼，但只有 app 自己的鍵盤能接受它，而那套鍵盤已不再出現：它既無法觸發也無法看到，只會讓隱私與安全裏那一行顯示為已啓用。輸入正確，我們就連同那一行一起把它關掉；輸入錯誤，本次什麼都不改，上面兩個新密碼也不會寫入。若驗證方式仍停在 app 密碼這一級，同時回退到系統驗證。這一步不會重建數據庫密鑰，聊天數據一個字符也不會動。";
