"Tap a contact to select them. Whoever is selected here is invited as soon as the group is created; select no one and the next step is the picker page." = "輕觸聯繫人即可選中。在這裏選中的人會在羣組創建後立即被邀請；一個都不選，下一步就是選人頁。";
"Tap the plus button at the top right to add a friend, start a group, or scan a QR code; your first chat appears here." = "點右上角的加號即可添加好友、發起羣組或掃 QR 碼；你的第一個會話會出現在這裏。";
"Tap to fix" = "輕觸修復";
"Tap to open and read" = "輕觸打開閲讀";
"Tap to switch to this identity" = "輕觸切換到這個身分";
"Tap to view the copy you sent" = "輕觸查看你發出的那份";
"Tap to view with biometric authentication" = "輕觸並用生物識別驗證查看";
"Tap-and-pass link" = "輕觸傳遞鏈接";
"Text" = "文本";
"Text block %lld" = "文本塊 %lld";
"Text, images and video" = "文字、圖片與視頻";
"That did not complete." = "那一步沒有完成。";
"That did not complete; no credits were taken." = "沒有完成，未扣除任何點數。";
"That did not complete; you can try again later." = "沒有完成，稍後可以再試。";
"The 240 most recent entries; older ones are dropped, the balance itself is not." = "只顯示最近 240 條；更早的會被丟棄，但餘額本身不會。";
"The Bluetooth mesh switch is off, so there are no pairings waiting for confirmation." = "藍牙 Mesh 開關已關閉，因此沒有待確認的配對。";
"The POPOPXAntiSpyDetector model was not found, so object detection is off and only the glare reflection fallback is working." = "未找到 POPOPXAntiSpyDetector 模型，因此物體檢測已關閉，只有反光檢測在兜底工作。";
"The QR image could not be read; use the redemption code text below instead." = "無法讀取 QR 圖片；請改用下面的兑換碼文本。";
"The alias is stored only on this device; other members are not notified." = "別名只保存在本機，不會通知其他成員。";
"The app left the foreground before the top-secret message was read" = "絕密訊息還未被閲讀，app 就退出了前台";
"The app went to the background, locked" = "app 進入後台，已鎖定";
"The arming has expired: switch the mode or the duration once to arm it again." = "備好推送已過期：切換一次模式或時長即可重新備好。";
"The avatar syncs only between this device and the members' devices. It is uploaded to no server." = "頭像只在本機與成員的設備之間同步，不會上傳到任何服務器。";
"The big line on the card" = "卡片上的大字";
"The boundaries of this badge" = "這枚徽章的邊界";
"The camera has not been authorised yet" = "相機尚未獲得授權";
"The camera is not available on this device" = "本機沒有可用的相機";
"The camera is not available on this device." = "本機沒有可用的相機。";
"The camera status cannot be read right now." = "當前無法讀取相機狀態。";
"The capture session cannot start (the camera is busy or there is no rear camera)" = "無法啓動採集會話（相機被佔用，或沒有後置攝像頭）";
"The card content was rejected: %@" = "卡片內容被拒絕：%@";
"The card did not reach the internet; check your connection and try again." = "這張卡沒有走到公網；請檢查網絡後重試。";
"The card exchange timed out, move close again" = "名片交換超時，請重新靠近";
"The card is not laid out yet; wait a moment and save again." = "卡片還沒排好版；請稍等後再保存一次。";
"The card was handed to the send queue, but the internet did not confirm it within the time limit; the mesh will resend it once the connection is back." = "卡片已交給發送隊列，但公網沒有按時確認；連接恢復後組網會重發一次。";
"The ciphertext or the key is incomplete, so it cannot be decrypted" = "密文或密鑰不完整，無法解密";
"The claim is kept in its own Keychain item on this device (readable only here, valid after the first unlock). No device identifier is uploaded." = "領取記錄保存在本機獨立的鑰匙串條目裏（只在這裏可讀，首次解鎖後生效）。不會上傳任何設備標識。";
"The clipboard holds an addable link" = "剪貼板裏有一條可添加的鏈接";
"The clipboard is empty." = "剪貼板是空的。";
"The connection is still being made, please try again later." = "連接仍在建立中，請稍後再試。";
"The content is empty." = "內容為空。";
"The core does not accept some of the characters in the group name. Fixing it removes them." = "羣名裏有核心不接受的字符，修正時會將它們去掉。";
"The credits exist only on this device; every debit and every refund is written to the ledger on it." = "點數只存在於本機；每一筆扣減與退回都會寫入本機賬本。";
"The credits were deducted and the badge was written to this device's Keychain." = "點數已扣除，徽章已寫入本機鑰匙串。";
"The credits were taken for this packet and no second one was opened. Resend it unchanged, or try again later." = "這個紅包已扣點，也沒有再開第二個。請原樣重發，或稍後再試。";
"The current interface state cannot host a secure window" = "當前介面狀態無法承載安全窗口";
"The device owner left the view" = "機主已離開畫面";
"The device's secure storage was unavailable; no credits moved." = "本機安全存儲不可用，點數沒有任何變動。";
"The device's signing key was unavailable, so this card could not be signed; no credits moved." = "本機簽名密鑰不可用，這張卡無法簽名，點數沒有任何變動。";
"The drill only feeds fixed synthetic samples into the very same detection code the real runtime uses. It does not lock the screen, does not wipe, and does not read the sensors on the phone in your hand." = "演練只把固定的合成樣本餵給真實運行時使用的同一套檢測代碼。它不會鎖屏、不會抹除，也不會讀取你手上這台手機的傳感器。";
"The drill uses a read-only comparison and does not consult the cool-down table, so this sentence can never appear on this page: it exists only because that result has one more possibility and the compiler requires the cases to be exhaustive. The row on the lock screen is where the cool-down actually lands." = "演練用的是隻讀比對，不查冷卻表，所以這句話在本頁永遠不會出現：它存在只是因為那個結果多一種可能，而編譯器要求分支窮舉。鎖定介面上的那一行才是冷卻真正落地的地方。";
"The drill will not really wipe: this row only asks which code the typed one matches, using the verification-only method; the path that leads to a wipe is not called here." = "演練不會真的抹除：這一行只用「僅驗證」的方式判斷輸入的是哪個碼；通向抹除的那條路徑在這裏不會被調用。";
"The duress code cannot be the same as the normal code" = "脅迫密碼不能與常規密碼相同";
"The duress code record is deleted from secure storage at once, and after that no input can trigger an erasure. The normal code stays. Switching it back on means setting both codes again." = "脅迫密碼記錄會立即從安全存儲刪除，此後任何輸入都觸發不了抹除。常規密碼保留。重新開啓需要再次設置這兩個密碼。";
"The encrypted service has stopped. Start it in Settings → Chat data, or restart the app; chats cannot be opened until it runs." = "加密服務已停止。請在 設置 → 聊天數據 中啓動，或重啓 app；它運行之前無法打開會話。";
"The encrypted service is starting; chats open in a moment." = "加密服務正在啓動，稍等即可打開會話。";
"The encrypted session is not ready yet" = "加密會話尚未就緒";
"The encrypted session is not ready yet — browse the lists for now and open a chat again later" = "加密會話尚未就緒 —— 請先瀏覽列表，稍後再打開會話";
"The encrypted session is not ready yet; the identity list appears once it is." = "加密會話尚未就緒；就緒後會出現身分列表。";
"The encrypted tunnel is not ready" = "加密通道尚未就緒";
"The encryption for this connection needs to be re-negotiated." = "這條連接的加密需要重新協商。";
"The encryption is being re-negotiated, please try again later." = "正在重新協商加密，請稍後再試。";
"The entry code is incorrect; the recovery phrase was not shown" = "入口密碼不正確，未顯示恢復助記詞";
"The existing entry passcode is incorrect; nothing was changed" = "已有的入口密碼不正確，未作任何改動";
"The existing self-destruct code is incorrect; nothing was changed" = "已有的自毀密碼不正確，未作任何改動";
"The export did not reach a completed state" = "導出沒有到達完成狀態";
"The export produced no result" = "導出沒有產生結果";
"The file attributes could not be read" = "無法讀取檔案屬性";
"The file content is empty" = "檔案內容為空";
"The file is not readable" = "檔案不可讀";
"The file size could not be read" = "無法讀取檔案大小";
"The first frame after coming back to the foreground is the lock screen, with no flash of content. Turning this off still leaves the inactivity timeout below in force." = "回到前台的第一幀就是鎖定介面，不會閃出任何內容。關掉它也不會讓下面的無操作超時失效。";
"The glare reflection fallback is switched off in settings." = "反光兜底檢測已在設置裏關閉";
"The group is deleted for every member; this cannot be undone." = "該羣組對每個成員都會被刪除，無法撤銷。";
"The group name contains illegal characters" = "羣名稱包含非法字符";
"The group name is the line shown in the chat list; the display name and the one-line summary appear only when you open the group profile." = "羣名稱是會話列表裏顯示的那一行；顯示名稱與一行摘要只在你打開羣資料時才會出現。";
"The guarantee is a type-level one in the implementation: this page only calls the static pure functions of the detection code and verify(pin:), and the latter is defined to have zero side effects; the method that leads to a wipe has no reference anywhere on this page." = "這份保證在實現上是類型層面的：本頁只調用檢測代碼的靜態純函數和 verify(pin:)，而後者被定義為零副作用；通向抹除的方法在本頁沒有任何引用。";
"The guard is switched off in settings" = "防護已在設置裏關閉";
"The highest tier in the group; you hold it yourself because you created the group." = "羣組裏的最高檔；因為羣是你創建的，所以由你自己持有。";
"The ledger and the balance on this device do not add up. The balance is still the sum of the ledger, but hold off on large exchanges until a reconciliation has run." = "本機的賬本與餘額對不上。餘額仍等於賬本之和，但在完成一次對賬之前，請暫緩大額兑換。";
"The level only changes the two snatch-and-drop thresholds. The free-fall test, the impact after weightlessness, uses fixed constants, so switching levels does not change it." = "檔位只改變搶奪掉落的兩項閾值。自由落體檢測 —— 失重之後的那一次衝擊 —— 用的是固定常量，所以換檔不會改變它。";
"The link is not ready yet, so there is nothing to share." = "鏈接尚未就緒，暫時沒有可分享的內容。";
"The link was not created: check your network and tap Retry." = "鏈接未能創建：請檢查網絡後點「重試」。";
"The mesh binding table has not finished loading" = "組網綁定表尚未加載完成";
"The mesh master switch is closed" = "組網總開關已關閉";
"The message is up to 60 characters; anything longer is cut off." = "留言最多 60 個字符，超出部分會被截斷。";
"The message was not delivered, so the threshold was not rewritten — the peer never received the new price. You can press again." = "訊息沒有送達，因此門檻也沒有改寫 —— 對方根本沒收到新價格。你可以再按一次。";
"The message was not sent: this chat connection is not available right now." = "訊息未發送：當前這條會話連接不可用。";
"The name is not valid" = "名稱無效";
"The near-field link could not be established: %@" = "近場鏈路無法建立：%@";
"The new random profile card will be shared." = "新的隨機名片將被分享出去。";
"The next step asks whether to delete only the chat or the contact as well." = "下一步會問你只刪除會話，還是把聯繫人也一起刪除。";
"The normal code opens the door; the duress code opens it and immediately erases the identities on this device. The two codes must be different, otherwise which code you hand over is the same question either way." = "常規密碼只開門；脅迫密碼開門後立即抹除本機的身分。兩個密碼必須不同，否則交出哪個都成了同一個問題。";
"The offline connection failed; please try again later" = "離線連接失敗，請稍後再試";
"The one-time connection is deleted right after; neither device keeps a contact record." = "一次性連接隨後即被刪除；兩台設備都不保留聯繫人記錄。";
"The only way out when you forget the entry passcode: type these 12 English words correctly on the lock screen and you can set a new entry passcode. The phrase is generated on this device, and secure storage keeps both its derived value for the lock screen to compare and the readable text, which exists only so this page can show it again." = "忘記入口密碼時唯一的出路：在鎖定介面正確輸入這 12 個英文單詞，就能重設新的入口密碼。助記詞由本機生成，安全存儲同時保存供鎖定介面比對的派生值和可讀文本，而可讀文本的存在只是為了讓本頁能再次顯示它。";
"The other device is the same identity as this one" = "對方設備與本機是同一個身分";
"The other side confirms the voucher has not been redeemed yet, then signs an authorization and sends it back." = "對方確認這張兑換券尚未被兑換，然後籤回一份授權。";
"The other side left the near field" = "對方已離開近場";
"The packet has to reach the other device: while it is undelivered the credits stay on your entry here and can be resent unchanged." = "紅包必須送達對方設備：未送達期間點數仍掛在你的記錄上，可以原樣重發。";
"The pairing policy is silent: the nearby exchange binds on its own when it finishes, so only requests that have not settled are listed here." = "配對策略是靜默的：附近交換完成時會自動綁定，所以這裏只列出尚未落定的請求。";
"The payload is damaged and cannot be opened" = "載荷已損壞，無法打開";
"The payload was not usable, so nothing was sent." = "載荷不可用，因此沒有發送任何內容。";
"The plain-text card is %1$lld bytes, over the %2$lld byte limit for a single Bluetooth Mesh message; trim the text and try again." = "明文卡片有 %1$lld 字節，超過單條藍牙 Mesh 訊息 %2$lld 字節的上限；請精簡文本後重試。";
"The plaintext and the originals were cleared, but this device's message row could not be deleted; open the chat again to confirm" = "明文與原件都已清除，但本機的這條訊息記錄沒能刪除；請重新打開會話確認。";
"The plaintext was erased from memory, but this device could not locate the record: it was not deleted." = "明文已從內存中抹除，但本機沒能定位到那條記錄：它沒有被刪除。";
"The profile identifier is not valid; the write was refused." = "身分標識無效，已拒絕寫入。";
"The profile mode this code will distribute" = "這個碼將要分發的身分模式";
"The public network is slow — also sending over Bluetooth mesh (%@)" = "公網較慢 —— 同時經藍牙 Mesh 發送（%@）";
"The public network is unavailable — messages go over Bluetooth mesh" = "公網不可用 —— 訊息走藍牙 Mesh";
"The publication did not go through" = "發佈未通過";
"The read failed, please try again later" = "讀取失敗，請稍後再試";
"The reading window for this profile page has expired" = "這個資料頁的查看時長已到期";
"The reading window starts counting when the friend opens it; when it ends, the content on this device and the image and video originals are destroyed together." = "查看時長從好友打開的那一刻開始計時；計時結束時，本機的內容與圖片、視頻原件一起銷燬。";
"The record on this device was deleted and the other side was notified." = "本機的記錄已刪除，並已通知對方。";
"The record on this device was deleted, with %lld notifications sent." = "本機的記錄已刪除，共發出 %lld 條通知。";
"The record on this device was deleted." = "本機的記錄已刪除。";
"The records of both codes were deleted" = "兩個密碼的記錄都已刪除";
"The records of the normal code and of the duress code are both deleted, and the lock screen falls back to only the app's own authentication gate. This step cannot be undone, but it deletes no chat data." = "常規密碼與脅迫密碼的記錄都已刪除，鎖定介面退回只走 app 自己的驗證閘門。這一步無法撤銷，但不會刪除任何聊天數據。";
"The recovery phrase is incorrect" = "恢復助記詞不正確";
"The recovery phrase needs 12 standard English words; check them word by word and try again" = "恢復助記詞需要 12 個標準英文單詞；請逐詞核對後重試。";
"The relay host names can be copied to troubleshoot connection problems." = "中繼主機名可以複製，用於排查連接問題。";
"The relay is used only when it is necessary; the other side may see your IP address." = "只在必要時才使用中繼；對方可能看到你的 IP 地址。";
"The request is on its way. Wait for the gifter's device to confirm — you can close this page, and the capsule lights up by itself once it lands." = "請求已在路上，等待贈送方設備確認 —— 你可以關閉本頁，結果落定後膠囊會自己亮起。";
"The reset did not complete; try again later" = "重置未完成，請稍後再試";
"The risk is still there. Closing destroys this message." = "風險仍然存在。關閉即銷燬這條訊息。";
"The router no longer has a delivery record for this card (%@); please send it again." = "路由器已沒有這張卡（%@）的投遞記錄；請重新發送。";
"The same price turned into a voucher you can send away; exchange several at once if you want." = "同一個價格換成可轉贈的兑換券；想的話可以一次兑換好幾張。";
"The screen is being recorded or mirrored" = "屏幕正在錄製或被投屏";
"The screen is being recorded or mirrored, so it was refused" = "屏幕正在錄製或被投屏，因此已拒絕";
"The screen is being recorded or mirrored, so opening was refused" = "屏幕正在錄製或被投屏，因此拒絕打開";
"The screen is judged suspicious and locked only when the angle stays past the chosen threshold for at least %1$@ s and there are at least %3$@ irregular touches inside %2$@ s. Smaller is more sensitive, and the price of a wrong call is one extra authentication." = "只有當視線角度持續超過所選閾值至少 %1$@ 秒，且在 %2$@ 秒內出現至少 %3$@ 次異常觸摸時，屏幕才判定為可疑並鎖定。數值越小越靈敏，誤判的代價只是多驗證一次。";
"The secure module is not ready, so the secure content was refused" = "安全模塊尚未就緒，因此已拒絕提供安全內容";
"The secure store on this device could not be reached, and no credits moved." = "無法訪問本機的安全存儲，點數沒有任何變動。";
"The sender set a gate of %1$lld Compute Credits on this copy; your balance is %2$lld Compute Credits. The unlock record is written only into this device's keychain." = "發送方在這份內容上設了 %1$lld 算力點的門檻；你的餘額為 %2$lld 算力點。解鎖記錄只寫入本機鑰匙串。";
"The sensor tests will definitely report false positives: going over a speed bump, throwing the phone into a bag or knocking it on a table corner can all hit. Precisely because they do, their consequence is always limited to one more authentication and can never lead to a wipe." = "傳感器檢測一定會誤報：過減速帶、把手機扔進包裏、磕到桌角都可能觸發。正因為如此，它們的後果永遠只是多驗證一次，絕不會通向抹除。";
"The sensors are sampling at 20Hz. Sampling stops the moment the screen locks, and also when the app moves to the background." = "傳感器正以 20Hz 採樣。屏幕一鎖定就停止採樣，app 進入後台時同樣停止。";
"The signature could not be obtained: the credits stay with this packet and are returned automatically when the grace period ends." = "未能取得簽名：點數仍隨這個紅包保留，寬限期結束後會自動退回。";
"The signature does not verify: this code is not the voucher that was issued." = "簽名校驗不通過：這個碼不是簽發的那張兑換券。";
"The signature does not verify: this is not the entry published by the channel owner." = "簽名校驗不通過：這不是頻道主發佈的那條記錄。";
"The signature does not verify: this is not the voucher that was issued." = "簽名校驗不通過：這不是簽發的那張兑換券。";
"The signature for this voucher was not created: this device's signing key is unavailable." = "未能生成這張兑換券的簽名：本機簽名密鑰不可用。";
"The signing key does not match the publisher recorded on this device from your last payment: either someone forwarded this card, or the channel owner changed devices." = "簽名密鑰與本機上次付款時記錄的發佈方不符：要麼這張卡被人轉手，要麼頻道主換了設備。";
"The store cannot be read right now: cards still show their list prices, and buying works again once the network is back." = "當前讀不到商店：卡片仍顯示標價，網絡恢復後即可正常購買。";
"The subscription did not go through" = "訂閲未通過";
"The tap-and-pass link did not go out" = "輕觸傳遞鏈接沒有發出去";
"The threshold guards admission on this device only; it does not change who the channel itself can broadcast to." = "門檻只在本機把守准入，不改變頻道本身能向誰廣播。";
"The threshold is set by the owner on their profile card; the unlock keeps a receipt on this device." = "門檻由主人在自己的名片上設定；解鎖回執保存在本機。";
"The threshold written on this card is 0." = "這張卡上寫的門檻是 0。";
"The ticket expires on %@. After that, this page will ask for credits again." = "票據於 %@ 到期。之後本頁會再次收取點數。";
"The ticket lives only in this device's Keychain: no server validates it, and none is needed." = "票據只存在本機鑰匙串裏：沒有服務器來驗證它，也不需要。";
"The timer only looks at whether anything touches the screen. Once it is locked the timer stops; it does not keep counting behind the lock screen." = "計時器只看屏幕有沒有被觸碰。一旦鎖定計時即停止，不會在鎖屏後面繼續累計。";
"The title is too long (%1$lld characters, limit %2$lld)" = "標題過長（%1$lld 個字符，上限 %2$lld）";
"The top bar shows this badge: it appears only while the badge is active and is withdrawn when it expires." = "頂欄會顯示這枚徽章：只在徽章有效期間出現，到期即撤回。";
"The top secret message cannot be opened; this device cannot locate the record" = "無法打開這條絕密訊息，本機定位不到該記錄";
"The top secret message is damaged and cannot be opened" = "絕密訊息已損壞，無法打開";
"The two entries do not match" = "兩次輸入不一致";
"The two entries match" = "兩次輸入一致";
"The underlying identity list could not be read: the chat core is unavailable right now, or this device really has no identity at all. Close this page and enter again, or first go back to the home page and check that the account is ready." = "無法讀取底層身分列表：聊天核心當前不可用，或者本機確實一個身分都沒有。請關閉本頁重新進入，或先回首頁確認賬户已就緒。";
"The voucher lives in this device's Keychain, and the check that it can be redeemed only once is on this device too. There is no voucher server, so there is no loss report, no remote revocation and no delivery receipt." = "兑換券存放在本機鑰匙串裏，只能兑換一次的校驗也在本機完成。沒有兑換券服務器，因此沒有掛失、沒有遠程撤銷，也沒有送達回執。";
"The way it is being handled does not match you, locked" = "持握方式與你不符，已鎖定";
"The whole screen is heavily blurred; only the circle under your finger stays sharp. Let go and it all blurs back." = "整屏高度模糊，只有手指下方的那一圈保持清晰；一鬆手就全部重新糊掉。";
"The word list is the standard BIP-39 English list of 2048 words, and the 12 words are derived from 16 random bytes plus a 4-bit checksum, so the order and the spelling both have to be copied exactly. The derivation uses PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 with 100,000 iterations, so one tap waits about a third of a second and that is not a hang; the Face ID button waits for the system sheet, which is not a hang either." = "詞表是標準的 BIP-39 英文 2048 詞表，12 個詞由 16 字節隨機數加上 4 位校驗和推導而來，所以順序與拼寫都必須精確照抄。推導使用 PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256、10 萬次迭代，因此輕觸一次要等約三分之一秒，這不是卡死；Face ID 按鈕在等系統彈窗，那也不是卡死。";
"The write failed, please try again later" = "寫入失敗，請稍後再試";
"Their device has not appeared in the mesh for a long time" = "對方設備已很久沒在組網裏出現";
"Their device has not exchanged mesh cards with yours; move closer once, or send over the internet" = "對方設備還沒有與本機交換過組網名片；請靠近一次，或經公網發送";
"Their invitation was accepted; waiting for them to let you in" = "已接受 TA 發來的邀請；正在等待對方放行";
"There are no contacts on this device yet. Create the group first, then let people join through the group link." = "本機還沒有聯繫人。請先創建羣組，再通過羣鏈接讓人加入。";
"There are no contacts to invite yet. After the group exists you can let people join through the group link." = "還沒有可邀請的聯繫人。羣組建好後，你可以用羣鏈接讓別人加入。";
"There is no interface available to show this profile page in" = "當前沒有可顯示這個資料頁的介面";
"There is no internet right now and the Bluetooth mesh cannot carry this card either: %@" = "當前沒有網絡，藍牙 Mesh 也帶不動這張卡：%@";
"These connections are not contacts yet, so they stay out of the contacts list and cannot be opened." = "這些連接還算不上聯繫人，因此不進聯繫人列表，也無法打開。";
"These credits are still recorded in your name; whatever is unclaimed when a packet expires goes back to your balance." = "這些點數仍記在你的名下；紅包到期時無人領取的部分會退回你的餘額。";
"These readings are what the sensor monitor collected itself: the peaks since this run started, and a conclusion only after a verdict has hit once. They are not the two numbers the drill computes." = "這些讀數是傳感器監視器自己採集的：本次運行以來的峯值，以及判定命中一次之後才給出的結論。它們不是演練算出的那兩個數值。";
"These two codes exist only as derived values; the plain text is never stored on this device. When you forget the entry passcode the only way out is the 12 English words you copied down by hand, and the mnemonic phrase itself has no recovery channel at all, so this write generates one on the way. Whether you copy it down is your call. That one tap in the confirmation dialog is the last gate on this consequence." = "這兩個密碼只以派生值存在，明文從不保存在本機。忘記入口密碼時唯一的出路，是你親手抄下的那 12 個英文單詞；助記詞本身沒有任何恢復渠道，所以這次寫入會順手生成一組。要不要抄下來由你決定。確認彈窗裏的那一次輕觸，就是這個後果之前的最後一道閘門。";
"They see this number first when they open the card, and it is only then taken from the balance on their own device. Empty or 0 is free to view; the limit is %lld and a larger number snaps to it. The threshold travels with the card - neither side of POPOPX can change it for them." = "對方打開卡片時先看到的就是這個數字，而且到那一刻才從他們自己的餘額里扣。留空或 0 為免費查看；上限是 %lld，更大的數會自動取到上限。門檻隨卡片一起傳遞，POPOPX 的任何一方都改不了它。";
"They type this code into the app or scan it, and this device creates a one-time SMP connection by itself." = "對方把這個碼輸進 app 或掃一下，本機就會自動創建一條一次性 SMP 連接。";
"This card (%@) is already in the relay queue, so it was not submitted twice." = "這張卡（%@）已經在中繼隊列裏，所以沒有重複提交。";
"This card was destroyed; nothing is kept on this device" = "這張卡已銷燬；本機不保留任何內容";
"This channel is free" = "這個頻道免費";
"This chat does not allow sending messages right now." = "當前這個會話不允許發送訊息。";
"This chat has been deleted, or it has not finished loading." = "這個會話已被刪除，或者還沒加載完。";
"This chat is not a 1-to-1 direct chat" = "這個會話不是單聊直連";
"This code cannot be decoded: it may be truncated, mistyped, or not from this version." = "這個碼無法解碼：可能被截斷、輸錯，或者不屬於當前版本。";
"This code is armed: they get this tier automatically once the scan connects" = "這個碼已備好推送：掃碼連上後對方會自動獲得這一檔";
"This code only opens the door; it does the same job as the app passcode gate upstream." = "這個碼只開門；它與上游的 app 密碼閘門做的是同一件事。";
"This code opens the door and at the same time erases the identities on this device. It is rejected outright if it equals the normal code." = "這個碼開門的同時會抹除本機的身分。若與常規密碼相同，會被直接拒絕。";
"This connection has been verified by its security code" = "這條連接已用其安全碼驗證過";
"This connection was not made with your main profile." = "這條連接不是用你的主身分建立的。";
"This contact cannot be invited" = "無法邀請該聯繫人";
"This contact cannot be invited into the group" = "無法把該聯繫人邀請進羣";
"This contact has no mesh binding yet" = "該聯繫人還沒有組網綁定";
"This device could not record the claim — try again later, or check the device's free storage." = "本機無法記錄這次領取 —— 請稍後再試，或檢查設備剩餘存儲空間。";
"This device does not allow opening secure messages right now." = "本機當前不允許打開安全訊息。";
"This device does not support the 640×480 export preset" = "本機不支持 640×480 導出預設";
"This device first verifies the signature inside the code, then connects to the gifter's device and sends the redemption request." = "本機先驗證碼內的簽名，然後連接贈送方的設備併發出兑換請求。";
"This device has no front camera" = "本機沒有前置攝像頭";
"This device has no mnemonic phrase yet. Generate one and copy the 12 English words onto paper right there and then." = "本機還沒有助記詞。請生成一組，並當場把 12 個英文單詞抄到紙上。";
"This device has no normal code set yet, so there is no record to compare against." = "本機還沒有設置常規密碼，因此沒有可比對的記錄。";
"This device has no precise ranging: stay within 1 metre and the cards exchange themselves once linked" = "本機沒有精確測距：請保持在 1 米內，連上後名片會自動交換";
"This device has no trace of where the record was stored, so the message cannot be located" = "本機已查不到該記錄存放位置的痕跡，因此無法定位這條訊息";
"This device has no unlock passcode yet — unlock first, then turn it on under Settings." = "本機還沒有解鎖密碼 —— 請先解鎖，再到設置裏打開。";
"This device has no usable Face ID or Touch ID, so the lock screen asks straight for the 6-digit keypad code." = "本機沒有可用的 Face ID 或 Touch ID，所以鎖定介面直接要求輸入 6 位鍵盤密碼。";
"This device has no usable biometrics, so secure messages cannot be opened" = "本機沒有可用的生物識別，因此無法打開安全訊息";
"This device has no usable identity; turn on Cabin in Settings first" = "本機沒有可用的身分；請先在設置裏開啓廂語";
"This device is being traced by a debugger, so opening was refused" = "本機正被調試器跟蹤，因此拒絕打開";
"This device only receives it quietly, nothing to do" = "本機只是靜默收到它，無需任何操作";
"This device rejects that threshold (it is 0 or above the allowed maximum); no credits moved." = "本機拒絕這個門檻（它為 0 或超過允許上限）；點數沒有變動。";
"This device sends the invitation" = "由本機發出邀請";
"This device still has the app's own entry passcode switched on: when unlocking it shows its keypad once first and POPOPX shows its keypad again, and the two keypads do the same job. Enter it correctly and we turn it off, so from now on only the normal code above is accepted. What goes off with it is the self-destruct code that only that old keypad could accept: once the old keypad is gone it has no way in, and keeping it would only make the row in Privacy and Security read enabled. This step does not rebuild the database keys and not one character of chat data moves; getting it back means setting it up again on the Privacy and Security page." = "本機還開着 app 自己的入口密碼：解鎖時它會先顯示一次自己的鍵盤，POPOPX 又顯示一次鍵盤，兩套鍵盤做的是同一件事。輸入正確我們就把它關掉，從此只接受上面那個常規密碼。隨之一起關掉的，是隻有那套舊鍵盤才能接受的自毀密碼：舊鍵盤一沒，它就再無入口，留着也只會讓隱私與安全裏那一行顯示為已啓用。這一步不會重建數據庫密鑰，聊天數據一個字符也不會動；想恢復就得在隱私與安全頁重新設置一遍。";
"This device's Bluetooth key is now bound" = "本機的藍牙密鑰現已綁定";
"This device's camera status is unknown" = "本機相機狀態未知";
"This device's clock was changed; the content was destroyed" = "本機的時鐘被改過；內容已銷燬";
"This device's record" = "本機的記錄";
"This did not complete, and no credits were taken." = "這一步沒有完成，也未扣除任何點數。";
"This did not complete." = "這一步沒有完成。";
"This did not complete; you can try again later." = "這一步沒有完成，稍後可以再試。";
"This draft cannot be marked secure while it is being rewritten, forwarded, recorded as a live message or already has an attachment." = "草稿正在改寫、轉發、錄製為實時訊息，或已帶附件時，無法把它標記為安全訊息。";
"This exchange did not take effect; %lld Compute Credits were refunded exactly, and the balance is unchanged." = "本次兑換沒有生效；已精確退還 %lld 算力點，餘額未變。";
"This image cannot be read; try another one." = "無法讀取這張圖片；請換一張。";
"This is neither a POPOPX link nor an online invitation link" = "這既不是 POPOPX 鏈接，也不是在線邀請鏈接";
"This is not in a channel: a threshold card only counts inside a channel, so no credits are charged here." = "這裏不在頻道內：門檻卡片只在頻道里計數，因此這裏不會收取點數。";
"This is the one you sent." = "這是你發出的那一份。";
"This is the threshold you published: credits are charged only when a member taps it." = "這是你發佈的門檻：只有成員輕觸時才會扣點。";
"This link only sets up a one-time encrypted connection — anyone who gets it can start a connection with you, so do not publish it." = "這個鏈接只建立一次性加密連接 —— 拿到它的任何人都能與你發起連接，所以不要公開它。";
"This link only sets up a one-time encrypted connection — anyone who gets it can start a connection with you, so do not publish it. The QR code carries no profile content: the content goes out as a single message only after the connection exists." = "這個鏈接只建立一次性加密連接 —— 拿到它的任何人都能與你發起連接，所以不要公開它。QR 碼不含任何資料內容：內容只在連接建立之後作為單條訊息發出。";
"This message does not give its text to the screen reader (VoiceOver)." = "這條訊息沒有把文本交給屏幕閲讀器（VoiceOver）。";
"This message has no more content" = "這條訊息沒有更多內容";
"This message has no time left to extend." = "這條訊息已沒有可延長的時長。";
"This message was deleted" = "這條訊息已刪除";
"This one table governs the numeric keypad, Face ID and the mnemonic phrase together, because all three verify the same thing: the owner in person. The first 4 failures only buzz and do not lock; a slip of the finger, or one digit off because of oil on the screen, should not be treated as an attack. The counter lives in secure storage, so it is still there after the process is killed and reopened." = "這一張表同時管着數字鍵盤、Face ID 與助記詞，因為三者驗證的是同一件事：機主本人。前 4 次失敗只震動、不鎖定；手指滑一下，或因屏幕油污輸錯一位，不該被當成攻擊。計數器保存在安全存儲裏，所以進程被殺掉再打開它仍然存在。";
"This packet did not go through" = "這個紅包沒有發出去";
"This packet was not delivered" = "這個紅包未送達";
"This page runs no connectivity test: there is no server to ask, so there is no decorative check button either." = "本頁不跑連通性測試：沒有服務器可問，所以也沒有那種裝飾性的檢查按鈕。";
"This person's messages will be shown again." = "這個人的訊息會重新顯示。";
"This person's new messages will be hidden." = "這個人的新訊息將被隱藏。";
"This profile cannot be sent for now: %@" = "這個身分暫時無法發送：%@";
"This profile cannot be sent: %@" = "這個身分無法發送：%@";
"This profile has %lld image or video blocks: they are skipped automatically on the offline Bluetooth Mesh path, which sends the text-only version." = "這份身分資料含 %lld 個圖片或視頻塊：在離線藍牙 Mesh 路徑上會自動跳過，只發出純文本版本。";
"This profile has no content" = "這份身分資料沒有內容";
"This profile has no content blocks yet; add text, an image or a video before you can send it." = "這份身分資料還沒有內容塊；請先添加文本、圖片或視頻，然後才能發送。";
"This profile holds too much (%1$lld bytes, limit %2$lld): cut some text or media" = "這份身分資料太大（%1$lld 字節，上限 %2$lld）：請刪掉一些文本或媒體";
"This profile is text only, so the online and the offline Bluetooth Mesh paths send exactly the same thing." = "這份身分資料只有文本，所以在線與離線藍牙 Mesh 兩條路徑發出的東西完全一樣。";
"This profile page does not use the front camera watch; only screenshot and screen recording detection stay on." = "這個資料頁不使用前置攝像頭看護；只保留截屏與錄屏檢測。";
"This profile page has no content blocks." = "這個資料頁沒有內容塊。";
"This profile page has nothing to show" = "這個資料頁沒有可顯示的內容";
"This profile page requires camera watch; allow camera access first" = "這個資料頁需要攝像頭看護；請先允許相機訪問";
"This profile's burn-after-reading time is not valid (%lld seconds)" = "這份資料的閲後即焚時長無效（%lld 秒）";
"This profile's content encoding is damaged and cannot be read" = "這份資料的內容編碼已損壞，無法讀取";
"This profile's content structure is damaged and cannot be read" = "這份資料的內容結構已損壞，無法讀取";
"This profile's data version is not recognised (%@); POPOPX has to be updated before it can open" = "這份資料的數據版本無法識別（%@）；需要更新 POPOPX 才能打開";
"This profile's delivery mode is not recognised (%@)" = "這份資料的送達方式無法識別（%@）";
"This profile's send mode is not recognised (%@)" = "這份資料的發送方式無法識別（%@）";
"This row decides what kind of account you hand over once the wipe is done. The first option only counts when you name which anonymous identity to keep, and that is identity information, not a preference." = "這一行決定抹除完成後你交出的究竟是什麼樣的賬户。第一個選項只有在你指定要保留哪個匿名身分時才計數，而那屬於身分信息，不是偏好設置。";
"This row is only a count kept on this device: while the badge is lit it increases once per fixed interval, and no relay node changes because of it." = "這一行只是本機保存的一個計數：徽章點亮期間它每固定間隔加一次，任何中繼節點都不會因此改變。";
"This row only decides which kind of account you hand over; it does not affect the wipe itself. Flipping it makes the simulated decoy generator re-read immediately instead of waiting for its own refresh." = "這一行只決定你交出的是哪一類賬户；它不影響抹除本身。切換它會讓模擬誘餌生成器立即重新讀取，而不用等它自己刷新。";
"This send" = "本次發送";
"This send skips %lld image or video blocks and sends the text-only version." = "本次發送跳過了 %lld 個圖片或視頻塊，只發出純文本版本。";
"This switch is bound to the behaviour test itself: flipping it starts or stops the sensors on the spot instead of waiting for the next launch. It only escalates to one more authentication and can never lead to erasure." = "這個開關綁定到行為測試本身：一按就當場啓動或停止傳感器，而不是等下次啓動。它最多升級成多驗證一次，絕不會引出抹除。";
"This system version does not support face-to-face adding; use Scan QR code instead" = "當前系統版本不支持面對面添加；請改用「掃 QR 碼」";
"This threshold is outside the allowed range (from 1 to the maximum; free needs no published threshold)." = "這個門檻超出允許範圍（從 1 到最大值；免費不需要發佈門檻）。";
"This top-secret message will not open" = "這條絕密訊息無法打開";
"This video cannot be read; try another one." = "無法讀取這段視頻；請換一段。";
"This voucher has already been redeemed on this device." = "這張兑換券已在本機兑換過。";
"This voucher has already been redeemed." = "這張兑換券已被兑換。";
"Thresholds" = "門檻";
"Ticket issued" = "票據已簽發";
"Tilt threshold" = "傾斜閾值";
"Title %1$lld / %2$lld characters" = "標題 %1$lld / %2$lld 字符";
