"Why a failure here does not enter the cool-down table: this prompt guards against an owner who got the words wrong, not against someone who holds the phone and guesses. If it counted, the settings page would become a second place to guess at, while an owner who once mis-copies, and getting 12 words out of order is common, would lock themselves into a 1 hour cool-down, exactly in the place where that hurts most. The prompt that really leads to a reset is on the lock screen, and only that one counts." = "這裏失敗為什麼不進入冷卻表：這道詢問防的是把詞抄錯的機主，而不是拿着手機亂猜的人。如果計入，設置頁就成了第二個可以猜的地方；而抄錯過一次的機主 —— 12 個詞抄亂順序很常見 —— 會把自己鎖進 1 小時冷卻，恰恰在最難受的地方。真正通向重置的詢問在鎖定介面上，只有那一次才計數。";
